{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33913","headline":"宏词下第感恩献兵部侍郎 · 皮日休","name":"宏词下第感恩献兵部侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分明仙籍列清虚，自是还丹九转疎。\n画虎已成翻类狗，登龙才变即爲鱼。\n空慙季布千金诺，但负刘弘一纸书。\n犹有报恩方寸在，不知通塞竟何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33913.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33913","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}